subparagraph.content:
by amending paragraph (10) to read as follows:

                                “(10) The term ‘District revenues’ means all funds derived from taxes, fees, charges, miscellaneous receipts, the annual Federal payment to the District authorized under title V, grants and other forms of financial assistance, or the sale of bonds, notes, or other obligations, and any funds administered by the District government under cost sharing arrangements.”
                            ;
